# 12. FLUX PRINCIPAUX

## Vente

```text
Customer
   ↓
Sale
   ↓
SaleItem
   ↓
Payment
   ↓
ProductVariant stock -
   ↓
StockMovement SALE
```

## Retour

```text
Sale
   ↓
SaleItem
   ↓
Return
   ↓
ProductVariant stock +
   ↓
StockMovement RETURN
```

## Achat fournisseur

```text
Supplier
   ↓
PurchaseOrder
   ↓
PurchaseItem
   ↓
Receive
   ↓
ProductVariant stock +
   ↓
StockMovement PURCHASE
```

## Inventaire

```text
Inventory
   ↓
InventoryItem
   ↓
Physical Count
   ↓
Difference
   ↓
Validate
   ↓
ProductVariant ajusté
   ↓
StockMovement INVENTORY_ADJUSTMENT
```

